Fields: Record-Type,Project-Contract-ID,Project-Contract-Version,Project-ID,Project-Version,Project-Scope,Supported-RRP-API-Version,Canonical-Profile-ID,Canonical-Profile-Version,Producer-ID,Producer-Version,Provider-ID,Provider-Version,Extension-Library-Path,State-Path
